{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>吳慷仁重返大陸發展，但「立場」問題始終揮之不去。像昨天只是分享重慶飲食讓他拉肚子，就有網友留言：「他不是搞台獨嗎？」吳慷仁直球回應：附上推</p><p>像昨天只是分享重慶飲食讓他拉肚子，就有網友留言：「他不是搞台獨嗎？」吳慷仁直球回應：</p><p>附上推眼鏡表情符號，一度衝上微博熱搜冠軍。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129442200602546176059318.jpeg/r3M2BZovltAC1lEVeuPz9UHTNd8kX_bj_PDIx_zwyMc\" alt=\"吳慷仁回覆網友立場問題。（微博@吳慷仁 WuKangRen）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁回覆網友立場問題。（微博@吳慷仁 WuKangRen）</figcaption></figure><p>點擊查看吳慷仁的相片：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117277839527936312780.jpeg/kasc4GvU2qmPf_RXsEx8-UKSE7nPh_zDjEnTeYxJ03k\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117280784060416630489.jpeg/jU40N4XhcBcsnSAR9ZcnCePF61dmbKiptuXJibblyYk\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117279265722368680951.jpeg/wjvOxFbulQ6-NczoeK7y2jBil2-3tUSrnNsW4ZzbFuE\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117280112971776602581.jpeg/R-P3q0YbZjAi4_H0inkOgM1mueY-6NqdeXGPTHlxj0w\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117275935182848750431.jpeg/uj_TjLJox-ctFu1wYu8GaXIt7l2M9_npsnXqrrJ16q4\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117277596258304029854.jpeg/23P4wwgppikSxum78PF9QC808M0TaT5DZjEFp2YxBac\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117276874706944587423.jpeg/b-SRxEW9nIgPkTD6kaULxFjAVyXr_mqWyD_hnMg_4Zw\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figur