img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117266422501376327056.jpeg/fYuu-Ju9Nz61mcLSakeUf6vh6S0x_ebp6L2VNui9lTY\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117261142003712532709.jpeg/-VDrRepQ3mwhrm5HI6xckgN_V9x7k_bHix3--osd_vo\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117264044199936794201.jpeg/KLaTbZSCCzPkdR0MJUTimZJ8QeJjYJMOZNvoUWTb6FE\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117261812699136713980.jpeg/KbMcLnJUkRBLRbzgUd8UzqmFCrtRIPuKfty4537cuOc\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117263256064000528496.jpeg/WCOJ1-yaGQWf5koAZ2ABPO9BU7JwOt8gLMgkICzIJCA\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117257111015424597681.jpeg/22uWDmYJuZUbpff7GyI68tpv9fIjbPrW8hrrLPIa6yw\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117259208298496823704.jpeg/2Uj0a0D4l-yw07cMs-5d5Fu2PfH_8uIe2KRE5dikROU\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918117255189893120027916.jpeg/t6c8hlcgoNsS-crBfUk3whS7j24ZLIc0elR8DnpUfA4\" alt=\"吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）\"><figcaption>吳慷仁（FB@kangrenwu）</figcaption></figure><p>2024年9月24日與大陸「壹心娛樂」簽約，前陣子他與孫儷「危險關係」播出，無論演技和訪談都讓不少當地人折服。不過，關於他的標籤也很多樣，演技好、幽默、有才華、模稜兩可、立場不清等都有。</p><p>吳慷仁積極經營大陸和香港市場，甚至也到非洲拍國際作品，演藝事業再創高峰。而他的第一部偶像劇《下一站幸福》的經典片段也不斷被挖出，安以軒無奈說出「光晞不行，他不能捐，讓拓也捐」，飾演拓也的吳慷仁在路上聽到網友喊這句台詞時還回：「都不要捐！」網友認為他第一部演技就這樣，難怪能拿金馬影帝。</p><p>延伸閱讀：59歲王祖賢罕曬單身日常　素顏攜愛犬漫步秀長腿　粉絲嘆依舊迷人</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647897869586432964813.png/jpW6VlaFLx4GQLkFbfMynLpsCmT7CMo40zbJPNM2yTw\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀：59歲王祖賢罕曬單身日常　素顏攜愛犬漫步秀長腿　粉絲嘆依舊迷人】有「永遠的小倩」之稱的王祖賢息影多年後定居加拿大，近年在溫哥華開設艾灸館，生活相當低調。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：59歲王祖賢罕曬單身日常　素顏攜愛犬漫步秀長腿　粉絲嘆依舊迷人】有「永遠的小倩」之稱的王祖賢息影多年後定居加拿大，近年在溫哥華開設艾灸館，生活相當低調。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647206555881472812374.png/c_XJ4-vCV_XHk2jy5LoPkVvcRxOb8D_JYiZv52Imb-c\" alt=\"近日她透過社交平台分享一段Vlog，公開近況與日常作息，再度引發粉絲關注。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>近日她透過社交平台分享一段Vlog，公開近況與日常作息，再度引發粉絲關注。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647895516450816593671.png/nQmzy1kgbUVnqtJHl2s2iKDVZPhjytNCvtsdI77bHSM\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647900495351808072946.png/u7j1bDR7spK9r012ldyQqu8x3BExFref_4vSx_-L0sc\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647903045619712893217.png/0UGBciv5PyMaj45DaO_mBqvVXocYarjNcxGpKHMRqSg\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647905436504064167309.png/45zGxAi_hlkvFyDRNr98CqezEVkVzyp3iJx2poicdqY\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647894484652032786594.png/yIl2BqsUW6WrNjelNg8BGL6LAL0AZDd_y6RPfsukT34\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647897013948416356401.png/Ulf9gb9QE3Tky4oc-BoC1w53WAa65Yav